# Linux keyboard + mouse check (tools/linux_run.py --env PS3_KBM=1): from the first save, at the docks once Wolfe's
# call plays (~60 s after the first world frame, Cole free to move), keys and mouse through X (tools/xtest.py)
# into the game window, a game-side shot after each. W walks forward, the mouse turns the camera (after a click
# captures it), Space jumps. Compare k0..k4: Cole moves, the view turns.
#! seconds 900
#! savefrom work\saves\first-save\gamedata
#! worldmark 20
anchorfile 840
at 62
xfocus inFAMOUS
shot k0
xkey w 2500
shot k1
xclick 1 60
xmove 600 0 30
shot k2
xkey space 120
sleep 0.4
shot k3
xkey s 1500
xmove -300 120 20
shot k4
xshot k4
close
